         "content": "## Query Firmware Versions\n\n### Direct API Call\ncurl http://localhost:11000/api/hardware/devices?categories=firmwares | jq\n\n### Expected Response\n{\n  \"firmwares\": [\n    {\n      \"hostname\": \"at3n2.tuc.stglabs.ibm.com\",\n      \"firmware_type\": \"bmc\",\n      \"name\": \"BMC\",\n      \"version\": \"0.50.d57cfd\",\n      \"updateable\": true,\n      \"status\": \"unknown\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n### Grafana Query Format\n{\n  \"targets\": [\n    {\n      \"target\": \"firmwares\",\n      \"refId\": \"B\",\n      \"type\": \"table\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n",
         "datasource": null,
