         "content": "## Grafana Datasource Health Check\n\n### Test Endpoint\ncurl http://localhost:11000/api/hardware/grafana/health\n\n### Expected Response\n{\n  \"status\": \"OK\"\n}\n\n### Search Endpoint\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:11000/api/hardware/grafana/search\n\n### Expected Response\n[\n  \"summary\",\n  \"storage_devices\",\n  \"processors\",\n  \"memory_dimms\",\n  \"network_adapters\",\n  \"power_supplies\",\n  \"fans\",\n  \"firmwares\",\n  \"criticals\"\n]\n\nThese are the available targets that can be queried\nin Grafana dashboard panels.\n",
